{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36868","headline":"冬暮寄裴郎中 · 罗隐","name":"冬暮寄裴郎中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晓髪星星入镜宜，早年容易近年悲。\n敢言得事时将晚，只恐酬恩日渐迟。\n南国倾心应望速，东堂开口欲从谁。\n仙郎旧有黄金约，沥胆隳肝更祷祈。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36868.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36868","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}